---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — IELTS Corner"
  description="Privacy policy for IELTS Corner. We respect your privacy and data."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--s-4);">Last updated: March 2, 2026</p>

    <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
      <div>
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>At IELTS Corner ("we," "us," "our," or "Company"), we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and use our services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Information you provide directly:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name and email address (when you contact us or sign up for the newsletter)</li>
          <li>Payment information (credit card or PayPal details, processed securely by Stripe)</li>
          <li>Essays or writing samples (for essay correction service)</li>
          <li>Any information you include in messages or contact forms</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP address and browser type</li>
          <li>Pages visited and time spent on site (via Google Analytics)</li>
          <li>Device type (mobile, desktop, etc.)</li>
          <li>Referring website</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To provide and improve our services (tutoring, essay correction, lessons)</li>
          <li>To process payments and maintain your account</li>
          <li>To send you newsletters and updates (only if you opt in)</li>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries and customer service requests</li>
          <li>To analyze website usage and improve user experience</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>3. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Secure HTTPS connection for all pages</li>
          <li>Payment information processed through Stripe (never stored on our servers)</li>
          <li>Regular security audits</li>
          <li>Restricted access to personal data (staff only when necessary)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell or share your personal information with third parties, except:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> Stripe (payments), Netlify (hosting), Google Analytics (analytics)</li>
          <li><strong>Legal requirement:</strong> If required by law or a court order</li>
          <li><strong>Your consent:</strong> If you explicitly agree to share information</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>5. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>We use cookies for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Functional cookies (remember your preferences)</li>
          <li>Analytics cookies (Google Analytics, to understand usage patterns)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can control cookie preferences in your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect site functionality.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of your personal data</li>
          <li><strong>Correct:</strong> Ask us to fix inaccurate information</li>
          <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Request deletion of your account and data (except where legally required to retain)</li>
          <li><strong>Opt out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>7. Newsletter</h2>
        <p>When you subscribe to our newsletter:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your email is stored securely</li>
          <li>You can unsubscribe at any time (link in every email)</li>
          <li>We only send tips, lessons, and updates about IELTS/CELPIP</li>
          <li>We do not share your email with anyone</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our services are not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children. If we become aware that a child under 13 has provided us with information, we will delete it immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with the "last updated" date. Your continued use of the site means you accept the updated policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: hello@ieltscorner.ca</li>
          <li>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/1234567890">Message us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr style="margin: var(--s-4) 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--text-muted-light);" />

      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
        IELTS Corner is committed to PIPEDA compliance (Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act) in Canada.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
